60","kind":"update","title":"Oct 21 Patch Notes - Tutorial Overhaul, Arena Balance & Bug Fixes!","summary":"Hey Shroom-lords!Over the past few days, we’ve been focusing on polishing combat feel, revamping the new player tutorial, and rolling out a targeted wave of balance adjustments and fixes for Arena Mode (PVP). Here are the details for today's update:Tutorial & QoL Improvements1. Brand-New Tutorial is Live· We have launched a reworked tutorial and are continuously polishing its flow and text. We hope this helps first-time players grasp our core mechanics much more smoothly without getting bogged d","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T14:35:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029052","verified_at":"2026-10-21T17:29:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4231860-1846651706694251","game_id":"steam-4231860","kind":"announcement","title":"Next Fest Event: Rank Up in PVP & Win Steam Gift Cards!","summary":"Hey everyone! Might & Mushroom is officially part of this Steam Next Fest! ːtobdogː We have just rolled out a massive overhaul update along with a special Arena Mode Leaderboard Event where you can win Steam Gift Cards!ːGhostFlowerHappyːNext Fest PVP Leaderboard EventTo celebrate the launch of our new Arena Mode, we are giving away a total of 13 Steam Gift Cards ($5 USD each)! Since the leaderboard is brand new, climbing into the Top 50 is super achievable right now—everyone who plays seriously ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T08:43:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694251","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4231860-1846651706680466","game_id":"steam-4231860","kind":"announcement","title":"Next Fest Confirmed! Asynchronous PvP Is Coming!","summary":"Hello, fellow mushroom adventurers! It's been a while!It's official: Might and Mushroom is joining Steam Next Fest on October 20! Over the two months since we relaunched the demo, we've been hard at work polishing and adjusting the game. Here's a look at what's changed!Art and UI UpdatesFirst up, we've refreshed our core art assets, including the mushroom unit info panels and the HP and Rage UI!We've also improved how battlefield information is displayed. Each unit's effects and changes to battl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T07:43:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706680466","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4231860-1839676055884817","game_id":"steam-4231860","kind":"announcement","title":"Back & Better Than Ever: Demo Relaunches After a Month of Polish!","summary":"Hello Shroom-mates! 🍄Since taking our Demo offline in early June, we’ve been working hard over the past month polishing and optimizing the game. Today, we’re super excited to announce that the Demo is officially back!We’ve completely revamped several core gameplay mechanics, upgraded the visuals, and improved overall QoL. These updates fix many of the painful friction points from the previous build while introducing fresh content and new layer of fun for everyone. We sincerely invite you all to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-30T10:27:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055884817","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4231860-1834602721189237","game_id":"steam-4231860","kind":"update","title":"Might & Mushroom Demo Temporary Takedown & Optimization Update Notice","summary":"Hello, dear players! Thank you so much for your attention, playtime, and feedback recently. We have received a massive amount of valuable optimization suggestions! To provide you with a better gaming experience, we are currently working on a comprehensive optimization of the game's core mechanics, stats, and overall progression. Because these changes are quite extensive, we have decided to temporarily take down the demo. We will re-upload it once the optimizations are complete. We plan to take d","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-05T02:05:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721189237","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4231860-1832065502808262","game_id":"steam-4231860","kind":"announcement","title":"\"Might & Mushroom Demo\" is Officially Out!","summary":"Hello everyone! We are thrilled to announce that the \"Might & Mushroom Demo\" is now live! In this trial version, you can experience the core gameplay and get a sneak peek into the world we’ve carefully crafted. Download the game now and join this unique battle! After playing, please don't forget to share your feedback and suggestions with us—your voice is incredibly important to us. Thank you for your continuous interest and support!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-06T09:00:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502808262","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4231860":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:42Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:49:41Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4231860":"2026-10-26T01:49:42Z"},"notices":[],"ne